NutriScope

A modern nutrition tracking and dietary analysis web application built as a single-file HTML project. NutriScope helps users monitor their daily nutritional intake, identify deficiencies, and receive personalized recommendations based on their dietary preferences.

Features

User Profile

- Age, Gender, Height, Weight
- Activity Level Selection
- Dietary Preference Support
  - Vegetarian
  - Non-Vegetarian
  - Eggetarian

Food Logging

- Add Food Items
- Quantity & Unit Tracking
- Editable Food Table
- Remove Entries
- Instant Nutrient Calculations

Nutrition Analysis

- Calories Tracking
- Protein Monitoring
- Carbohydrate Analysis
- Fat Tracking
- Fiber Analysis
- Iron Monitoring
- Calcium Tracking
- Vitamin C Analysis
- Vitamin D Monitoring
- Vitamin B12 Tracking

Dashboard

- Energy Progress Indicators
- Macro Nutrient Charts
- Nutrient Completion Tracking
- Deficiency Detection
- Excess Intake Detection
- Interactive Data Visualization

Advanced Features

- CSV Upload Support
- Expanded Food Database
- Additional Micronutrients
- 2-Day Meal Planner
- Risk Analysis
- Advanced Recommendations
- Educational Nutrition Guidance

Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Chart.js

Learning Outcomes

- Prompt Engineering
- Frontend Development
- Data Visualization
- UI/UX Design
- Nutrition Analytics
- Single-Page Application Development

